 "description": "<p>A wedding-night set that skips the gown and keeps the iconography: embroidered roses on white polyester, a veil, a sleeve pair, a leg ring, and a thong. Five pieces in total, each doing one job in the bride look.</p>\n<p>The embroidery is the differentiator - printed florals fade into fabric, while stitched roses hold their edges at close range, which is exactly the range that matters here. The veil is short enough to stay out of the way, and the leg ring replaces the garter tradition with something you can actually keep on.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: veil, dress, sleeves, leg ring, thong</li>\n<li>Style: bride, rose embroidery</li>\n<li>Color: white</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 45-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Sized for 45-60 kg. The white-on-white palette means it photographs clean under warm light.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>White bridal lingerie set with rose embroidery, veil, sleeves, leg ring and thong, one size for 45-60 kg.</p>\n",
